4,Atsawaka language — Grokipedia,https://grokipedia.com/page/atsawaka_language,"The Atsawaka language, also known as Atsahuaca or Atsawaka-Yamiaka, is an extinct Panoan language of the Amazonian region, formerly spoken by small indigenous groups in southeastern Peru.",Atsahuaca,Panoan
